  (woodland location4)
Goal:
  (and (>= (housing location1) 1) (>= (housing location3) 2) (has-sawmill location2) (has-sawmill location3))
Metric:
  (+ (+ (* 2 (pollution)) (* 3 (resource-use))) (* 0 (labour)))
Pred prop:
  (by-coast place): in_init in_pre
  (connected-by-land place place): in_init in_pre
  (connected-by-rail place place): in_pre in_eff
  (connected-by-sea place place): in_init in_pre
  (has-cabin place): in_pre in_eff
  (has-coal-stack place): in_pre in_eff
  (has-docks place): in_pre in_eff
